  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OGP: Support Open and Accountable Use of Emerging Digital Technologies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to promote open and accountable use of emerging digital technologies, especially the need for democratic safeguards, through translating global pledges to country action. Specifically, the project will: Support country-level progress on digital governance reforms (Priority countries: Ghana, Indonesia, Kenya, Nigeria, Dominican Rep); Accelerate collective action and norm-raising on digital governance; Increase the impact of global fora on democracy by better linking different initiatives, and ensuring global pledges are translated into country action.</narrative>
  </description>
